{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34038","headline":"鸳鸯二首 一 · 皮日休","name":"鸳鸯二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双丝绢上爲新样，连理枝头是故园。\n翠浪万回同过影，玉沙千处共栖痕。\n若非足恨佳人魄，即是多情年少魂。\n应念孤飞争别宿，芦花萧瑟雨黄昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}